message: "If you use this code or dataset, please cite the manuscript and this repository."
type: software
title: "Code and data for: Phage-antibiotic synergy in ESKAPE pathogens - a scoping review of antibiotic-partner selection"
abstract: >-
  Extraction dataset (419 observations from 157 studies, extended to 442 from 166 studies in v1.1.0), derived data tables, screening audit trail and analysis code
  reproducing every number, table and statistic in the accompanying scoping review
  of antibiotic-partner selection for phage-antibiotic synergy against ESKAPE pathogens.
